{
  "id": "6aeec2a53ed8c8b1afbe83d1",
  "title": "百合とみなす基準",
  "created": 1794032313,
  "updated": 1794050472,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aeec2a53ed8c8b1afbe83d1",
      "text": "百合とみなす基準",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032313,
      "updated": 1794032313
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec2de0000000000b0883c",
      "text": "#百合 #レズビアン",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032351,
      "updated": 1794032422
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec2e30000000000b0883d",
      "text": "なんかいろいろある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032357,
      "updated": 1794032444
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec2ef0000000000b0883e",
      "text": "　女性同士恋愛感情があれば百合",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032368,
      "updated": 1794032382
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec3500000000000b08841",
      "text": "　　わかる[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032465,
      "updated": 1794032469
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec3850000000000b08849",
      "text": "　　わからない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032518,
      "updated": 1794032520
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec2fe0000000000b0883f",
      "text": "　女性同士恋愛感情がなくても百合（女が2人いれば百合）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032383,
      "updated": 1794032614
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec3810000000000b08848",
      "text": "　　わかる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032514,
      "updated": 1794032516
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec3550000000000b08842",
      "text": "　　わからない[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032470,
      "updated": 1794032474
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec3a00000000000b08868",
      "text": " 深い友情、絆があれば百合",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794032545,
      "updated": 1794038799
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedbfe0000000000935848",
      "text": "  わかる[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794038783,
      "updated": 1794038822
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedc200000000000935849",
      "text": "  わからない[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794038817,
      "updated": 1794040022
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeee10600000000007de24a",
      "text": "  \tベッドシーンにもつれ込む未来が見えない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794040069,
      "updated": 1794040088
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeee13d00000000007de24b",
      "text": "  \t例えば、女二人で同棲している仲で、尚且つそれぞれが男遊びしているような場合でも百合…？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794040124,
      "updated": 1794040248
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeea1000000000003a9c80",
      "text": "  \t[魔法少女ノ魔女裁判]的な物を想定していた[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794042385,
      "updated": 1794042424
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeea3800000000003a9c81",
      "text": "  \t 特に恋愛描写はないがしばしば百合と形容される",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794042425,
      "updated": 1794042461
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeeb5600000000003a9c83",
      "text": "  \t  [公式の見解 https://x.com/13witch_Trials/status/1777560924263743642]としては「見方による」らしい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794042712,
      "updated": 1794042742
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeed480000000000f63368",
      "text": "  \t まのさばが百合たる所以、ちゃんと考えると言語化が難しい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794043210,
      "updated": 1794043246
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeed6d0000000000f63369",
      "text": "  \t  あとで整理する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794043246,
      "updated": 1794043285
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeeed860000000000f6336a",
      "text": "  \t  1つ言えるのは女性同士の恋愛を前提にした百合ではないということ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794043272,
      "updated": 1794043320
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec2b80000000000b0883a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032313,
      "updated": 1794032313
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedc28000000000093584a",
      "text": "百合とレズは若干のニュアンス差がある気もする[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794038826,
      "updated": 1794038871
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedc57000000000093584c",
      "text": " 百合の方がラフで広義、的な",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794038872,
      "updated": 1794039158
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedc28000000000093584b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794038826,
      "updated": 1794038826
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec4170000000000b0886e",
      "text": "対義語？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032664,
      "updated": 1794032667
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec41a0000000000b08870",
      "text": "　ホモとみなす基準",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032667,
      "updated": 1794032675
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeec4390000000000b08871",
      "text": "　ゲイとみなす基準",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794032698,
      "updated": 1794032704
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedd4c00000000001a28f8",
      "text": "　BLとみなす基準",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794039116,
      "updated": 1794039125
    },
    {
      "id": "6aeedd4c00000000001a28f9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794039117,
      "updated": 1794039117
    },
    {
      "id": "6aef097100000000001b5d06",
      "text": "[https://api.iconify.design/mdi/fleur-de-lis.svg?width=127&color=%23e8e8e8]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794050418,
      "updated": 1794050419
    },
    {
      "id": "6aef097300000000001b5d07",
      "text": "百合の紋章（フルール・ド・リス）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
